---
source: crates/cupel-cli/src/render/text/description.rs
expression: "plain(&Description::Command(baseline))"
---
cupel baseline · Set, show, diff, export, or import the baseline runs are compared with. · experimental
  arguments
    --name NAME  Which named baseline; default `default`.
  examples
    $ cupel baseline show  # Print the baseline. (exit 2)
  sub-verbs
    cupel baseline set · Name the latest result run, or a given run, as the baseline; previews without --write.
      arguments
        --from run:ID  The run to use instead of the latest.
      examples
        $ cupel baseline set --write  # Name the latest result run, or a given run, as the baseline; previews without --write. (exit 2)
    cupel baseline show · Print the baseline.
      examples
        $ cupel baseline show  # Print the baseline. (exit 2)
    cupel baseline diff · Compare two runs as an envelope of new and resolved findings.
      arguments
        --against run:ID|REF  baseline, run:ID, or a git ref to compare the latest result run with; default baseline.
      examples
        $ cupel baseline diff  # Compare two runs as an envelope of new and resolved findings. (exit 2)
    cupel baseline export · Write the baseline to a file as JSON.
      arguments
        <FILE>  Where to write the baseline.
                path · required
      examples
        $ cupel baseline export baseline.json  # Write the baseline to a file as JSON. (exit 2)
    cupel baseline import · Read a baseline from a JSON file; previews without --write.
      arguments
        <FILE>  The baseline to read.
                path · required
      examples
        $ cupel baseline import baseline.json  # Read a baseline from a JSON file; previews without --write. (exit 2)
